    "working_spec_screening": "At exact 45-min (2700 s) half-time in 33 C intermittent running, Complex Stroop accuracy drops -3.3 pp (98.3->95.0%, reaching -4.5 pp at 90 min) while RT stays near baseline (+4 ms); at 90 min high-load working memory (Sternberg 5-item) slows by +49 ms (exceeding EXP-0149 working_default +40 ms). Group means only (data request-only), no individual time-series, no mechanical work/power, no spatial meters, and no post45 neuromuscular battery."
