  "summary_ruling": "EXP-0157 expands Stage 2 with individual paired multi-bout intermittent heat-stress data (SSGs_Heat n=16 x 3 heat levels x 2v2/4v4, jointly measuring Core Temp, locomotor distance pacing in meters, HR %max, and technical motor accuracy) plus exact 45-min (2700 s) half-time intermittent heat cognitive data (Malcolm 2024 n=12). Stage 2 remains HOLD / DATA_BLOCKED: no open human dataset combines full >=2700 s alternating load, calibrated mechanical power/velocity, spatial coordination in meters, concurrent cognition, thermoregulation, and post45 recovery."
